Each connector binds a third-party SDK's outbound call to an AlgoVoi keystone
decision and emits a content-addressed execution_ref, built on the AlgoVoi
substrate: RFC 8785 (JCS) canonicalisation + SHA-256, recomputable offline.

Third-party SDK names (AWS SQS/SNS/DynamoDB, Azure Blob/Service Bus, Google
Cloud Pub/Sub, Celery, httpx, Pinecone, Qdrant) are the property of their
respective owners and are referenced only to describe what each adapter wraps.
No third-party SDK code is included or redistributed here.
